    "name":  "LED Controller 2-in-1 | Single Color + CCT | RF 2.4GHz | 12-24V",
    "reference":  "FL0788-FUT035S+",
    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003eDiscover the \u003cstrong\u003e2-in-1 Dimmer Controller for LED strips\u003c/strong\u003e. Designed for monochrome and CCT (dual white) strips, this RF 2.4 GHz dimmer allows you to adjust intensity and program dynamic effects. With capacity to control \u003cstrong\u003eup to 4 different zones\u003c/strong\u003e from a single remote control and a \u003cstrong\u003e30-meter range\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith output power of \u003cstrong\u003e6A per channel\u003c/strong\u003e and total maximum of \u003cstrong\u003e12A\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2\u003eLED Controller 2-in-1 | Single Color + CCT | RF 2.4GHz | 12-24V\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e2-in-1 LED Controller. Single color and CCT modes. 2.4GHz RF. 12-24V. Up to 4 zones, 30m range. 6A per channel, 12A total.\u003c/p\u003e",
